usage: evaluate.py [-h] [--config CONFIG]
                   --name {standard,beta_003,beta_010,beta_030,length_balanced,sft}
                   [--phase {policy,reward}] [--adapter ADAPTER]
                   [--models-dir MODELS_DIR] [--output OUTPUT]
                   [--backup-root BACKUP_ROOT]
                   [--policy-results POLICY_RESULTS] [--plan]

Run one fixed Task 1 evaluation phase and verify its persistent backup. Policy
scoring/generation and reward replay are separate invocations. Importing this
module or requesting --plan never loads model weights or creates results.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --config CONFIG
  --name {standard,beta_003,beta_010,beta_030,length_balanced,sft}
  --phase {policy,reward}
  --adapter ADAPTER
  --models-dir MODELS_DIR
  --output OUTPUT
  --backup-root BACKUP_ROOT
  --policy-results POLICY_RESULTS
  --plan                CPU-only full-pool validation; no model loading

